# neo_dft_epc finished by the trust-region solver, with analytic
# Hessian-vector products including the XC and EPC responses
System H2O.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
ProtonBasis PB4-D
QuantumProtons 2
Method lda_x-lda_c_vwn
EPCFunctional lda_c_epc17_2
DFTGrid 75 -302
MaxIter 3
TrustRegion true
SaveChk neo_dft_epc_tr.chk
